<title>PHILIPPINES: PLDT board approves 100 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>PLDT board approves 100 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of the Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co approved on Tuesday a 100 percent stock dividend on the company's common capital stock.</p>
<p>PLDT senior vice-president Enrique Perez told the Philippine Stock Exchange, the dividend will be payable to stockholders on record as of May 15, 1997.  </p>
<p>The stock dividend will be payable on June 30, 1997, the company official said.</p>
<p>Perez said the dividend declaration will be submitted to stockholders for approval at the annual meeting on April 16.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
